{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8a7d6006945d2809f04","chatId":"5a1e4484ba554239a2e6a94948ab88e8","sessionId":null,"userId":68226,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"E\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"E\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1228,"promptTokens":1568,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:43"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00668960730262114,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8a7d6006945d2809f03","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369703738,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:43","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8a7d6006945d2809f03","chatId":"5a1e4484ba554239a2e6a94948ab88e8","sessionId":null,"userId":68226,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n妈妈在出门买菜前让我洗衣服，我也答应了。但她走了以后我又懒得做。毫无察觉时，妈妈突然在楼下叫我，我下楼时意识到我有麻烦了。她问我我洗没洗衣服，我心虚地避开她的目光，嘴上却说做了。等妈妈做饭时，我立马冲上楼洗衣服。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，母亲最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 尴尬 & 爱护\nB) 爱护 & 惊喜\nC) 信任 & 爱护\nD) 没意识的 & 惊喜\nE) 没意识的 & 自豪\nF) 没意识的 & 信任\n\n## 问题 2\n母亲为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她认为我按照她要求洗了衣服 & 她没有看见我下楼\nB) 她不知道我撒谎了 & 她没有看见我下楼\nC) 她感激我做家务 & 在做晚饭之前，她的心情很好\nD) 她认为我按照她要求洗了衣服 & 在做晚饭之前，她的心情很好\nE) 她认为我按照她要求洗了衣服 & 她不知道我撒谎了\nF) 她知道我没有按照她的要求去做洗衣服 & 她没有看见我下楼","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00668960730262114,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8a7d6006945d2809f04","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369703735,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:43","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ddcfa99582124eddb9032fd501b543c4"}